  "description": "BundleTransformer.TypeScript contains one translator-adapter - `TypeScriptTranslator`. This adapter makes translation of TypeScript code to JS code. Also contains the `TypeScriptAssetHandler` debugging HTTP handler, which is responsible for text output of translated TypeScript asset.",
