  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE-DESCRIPTION.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1. Added support for the TypeScript version 6.0 RTM (please note: The 6.0 RTM release is also called '6.0.2');\n2. In configuration settings of the TypeScript translator:\n\t2.1. Become obsolete the `DownlevelIteration` property and the `EcmaScript5` value of the `Target` property;\n\t2.2. Changed the default values of nine properties from `false` to `true`: `AlwaysStrict`, `NoImplicitAny`, `NoImplicitThis`, `StrictBindCallApply`, `StrictBuiltinIteratorReturn`, `StrictFunctionTypes`, `StrictNullChecks`, `StrictPropertyInitialization` and `UseUnknownInCatchVariables`;\n\t2.3. Changed the default value of the `Target` property from `EcmaScript5` to `EcmaScript2015`;\n\t2.4. Added one new property - `StableTypeOrdering` (default `false`).",
